{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aquasecurity/trivy-db/pulls/701","id":4898913908,"node_id":"PR_kwDODOyR6c8AAAABI_9-dA","html_url":"https://github.com/aquasecurity/trivy-db/pull/701","diff_url":"https://github.com/aquasecurity/trivy-db/pull/701.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/aquasecurity/trivy-db/pull/701.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aquasecurity/trivy-db/issues/701","number":701,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"fix(debian): retain advisories with undetermined sid versions","user":{"login":"XHW-ZJU","id":187075542,"node_id":"U_kgDOCyaL1g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/187075542?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/XHW-ZJU","html_url":"https://github.com/XHW-ZJU","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/XHW-ZJU/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/XHW-ZJU/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/XHW-ZJU/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/XHW-ZJU/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/XHW-ZJU/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/XHW-ZJU/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/XHW-ZJU/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/XHW-ZJU/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/XHW-ZJU/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nNormalize the bare `undetermined` SID fixed-version sentinel to the existing empty fixed-version representation before storing `sidFixedVersions`.\n\nThis retains the advisory and vulnerability ID as unknown/unfixed. Valid Debian fixed versions and errors for unrelated invalid versions remain unchanged. No CVE-specific skip, dependency change, or metadata rewrite is introduced.\n\n## Root cause\n\nThe [official database build](https://github.com/aquasecurity/trivy-db/actions/runs/39008766209) fails while processing `CVE-2026-111142` for `zziplib`: the tracker serializes a bare `undetermined` status as a fixed-version string, and Debian version comparison rejects it with `upstream_version must start with digit`.\n\nRelated: #700. This patch keeps the advisory represented in the database.\n\n## Verification\n\nTested against upstream commit `cbebf2ecd6df42d36463844a45e689afee51c70f`.\n\n- The same regression test bytes fail on the original source for `undetermined` and pass with this patch.\n- Four cases cover retained unknown version, retained unfixed advisory, preserved valid fixed version, and continued rejection of an unrelated invalid version.\n- Tests read the stored advisory and vulnerability ID.\n- `GOMAXPROCS=2 go test -p 2 -v ./pkg/vulnsrc/debian -run '^TestVulnSrc_UpdateSidVersion$' -count=1` passes.\n- `GOMAXPROCS=2 go test -p 2 ./pkg/vulnsrc/debian -count=1` passes.\n\n### Real Debian feed verification\n\nThe patched upstream CLI also completed `build --only-update debian` using the complete Debian feed snapshot `ac69e0aa38942c47b5cca37e28d31dffe7623a34`.\n\nReadback of the produced database with the official bbolt CLI confirms:\n\n- `debian 13 / zziplib / CVE-2026-111142` exists without a fixed version; the associated vulnerability has unknown severity.\n- `debian 13 / zziplib / CVE-2024-39133` retains fixed version `0.13.78+dfsg.1-0.1`, matching its feed input.\n\nThis is Debian-only verification. A complete multi-source database build and official publication have not been verified.\n","created_at":"2026-10-17T09:22:04Z","updated_at":"2026-10-17T09:24:40Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"2ce17005f6942cbc581870d0b610d7b04128b62b","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"knqyf263","id":2253692,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTM2OTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2253692?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/knqyf263","html_url":"https://github.com/knqyf263","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/knqyf263/follow